<title>EGYPT: Egyptian Gulf Bank Q1 97 results.</title>
<headline>Egyptian Gulf Bank Q1 97 results.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the first quarter of calendar 1997, the bank's financial year.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, comparative figures from the previous year in brackets):</p>
<p>Total deposits	    1,200,444,250  (658,619,315)</p>
<p>Total assets		1,616,504,796  (864,398,890)</p>
<p>Reserves			 13,426,657   (17,980,988)</p>
<p>Provisions		     80,150,190   (64,555,392)</p>
<p>Shareholders funds	  137,916,257   (91,283,774)</p>
<p>Distributable profits	17,478,090    (4,554,331)</p>
<p>(Full name Egyptian Gulf Bank)</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
